SQLite 3.54.1: check physical worker-stack headroom during recursive SQL compilation.

Local cpktdb patch applied after sqlite_expression_worklist.patch.
Cache OS-thread bounds in TLS, with 32 KiB reserved for errors and cleanup.
Parse/code-generation paths report a normal SQLite error. Clone allocation
paths retain their existing NULL/mallocFailed resource-failure contract.
Expression comparison may conservatively forgo an optimization.

